3.8 GL/CC Prediction Module
File: gl_cc_logic.py

Core prediction engine that calculates GL Code and Cost Centre with confidence scores.

Key Functions:

Function	Purpose
main_gl_cc_predict()	Main pipeline for GL/CC prediction
_parse_date()	Parse dates in various formats
_update_freq_and_recency()	Update frequency and recency metrics
_finalize_group()	Calculate final scores and normalize
_pick_best()	Select best prediction with confidence
Confidence Score Formula:

confidence = (w_score × max_score) + (w_freq × freq) + (w_recency × recency)

Where:
- max_score: Highest semantic similarity score from vector search
- freq: 1 - e^(-k_f × count)  (exponential frequency calculation)
- recency: Σ e^(-λ × days)    (exponential decay based on days since invoice)
Grouping Logic:

Prediction Type	Grouping Logic
GL Code	Group by GL code across all matching historical records
Cost Centre	Group by CC code, filtered by current approver's history
Prediction Modes:

"both" - Predict both GL and CC (default)
"gl_only" - Predict only GL Code
"cc_only" - Predict only Cost Centre
Split Prediction Logic: When approver filter removes all CC data but GL data exists:

Get CC codes from pre-match data (all candidates)
Get GL codes from post-match data (LLM-matched only)
Merge results
