6.2 Parameter Reference
Confidence Score Parameters
Parameter	Type	Description
recency_weight	float	Weight for recency in legacy calculation
frequency_weight	float	Weight for frequency in legacy calculation
lambda_decay	float	Decay factor for exponential recency (default: 0.01)
recent_count	int	Number of recent occurrences to consider for recency
how_many_recent_gl_to_consider	int	Top N codes to retain recency scores
k_f_coefficient_for_frequency_calculation	float	Coefficient for exponential frequency (default: 0.03)
confidence_threshold	float	Threshold for low confidence flagging
GL/CC Weightage Configuration
Parameter	Type	Description
weightage_for_confidence_score_calculation_gl.score	float	Weight for semantic similarity score (GL)
weightage_for_confidence_score_calculation_gl.w_freq	float	Weight for frequency (GL)
